# PLANET'EnR site

Static React clone of planet-enr.fr (not WordPress). Full map: `AGENTS.md`.

- Stack: Node 24, React 18, Vite 7 (`build/` outDir, port 3000), TypeScript, Bootstrap 5 + react-bootstrap, react-router-dom 6, react-helmet-async, gh-pages.
- Keep WordPress slugs: `/`, `/nos-conseils`, `/carport`, `/nos-partenaires`, `/contact`, `/mentions-legales`.
- Shared chrome: `src/components/Layout.tsx` + `src/nav.ts`. Pages live in `src/pages/`. Theme in `src/site.css`. Assets in `public/images/`.
- Contact is `mailto:relation@planet-enr.fr` (GitHub Pages has no WPForms). Validate matching emails client-side.
- SPA on GitHub Pages: keep `index.html` + `public/404.html` rafgraph redirect (`pathSegmentsToKeep = 0`).
- No PHP, no new backend, no force-push. Commit/deploy only when asked.
